# Environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Data artefacts — the app's SQLite database lives in the browser's OPFS, but an exported
# copy, dump, or backup dropped in the repo root while testing the persistence paths would
# carry real content into a public repo. The pre-commit scan only reads added *lines*, so it
# cannot flag a binary .sqlite. Keep them out by rule instead.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.sql

# Keys, certificates, and keystores — never commit a private key or credential store.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cer
*.pfx
*.p12
*.keystore
*.jks
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_dsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
